==Battleground==
*2 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Gary Gory]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ms. Madonna]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Gary Gory|Gary Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 66.67~72 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,160f</sup>.
**3 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher A]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is fairly simple. Because so few enemies spawn in the beginning, you can easily stall for money using [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]], and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]]. After that, use [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to block the Wave Attacks and piercers like [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] or [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]].

